status GREEN on eight named guards run by hand -- amphora_manifest_agrees, amphora_roster, reds_ledger_monotone, unshared_citation, living_card_ascii, index_row_bound, tame_style_check, width-check; neither full roster pass closed at load 14 and both partial readings are named in the card rather than claimed as a pass
recommend keep-going -- the far-manifest door still asks only whether a listing is present, and whether one is required is a testimony decision rather than a lap
